<div class="info-page">
  <section class="info-hero">
    <span class="info-eyebrow">QUESTIONS & ANSWERS</span>
    <h1>Everything You Need to Know</h1>
    <p>Thoughtful answers to the things women ask us most.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="info-body">
    <div class="info-content">

      <h2>About Vivere</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What is Vivere?</h3>
        <p>Vivere is premium nightwear for women who believe the way you end your day matters. We use the same fabrics and finishing as international luxury houses — modal blends, satin finishes, considered lace — and make them accessible.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What makes Vivere different?</h3>
        <p>We stripped away the excess markup and kept the quality. Every piece is crafted with premium materials, thoughtful design, and ethical manufacturing. The difference is something you feel the moment you put it on.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <h2>Sizing & Fit</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How do I find my size?</h3>
        <p>Our <a href="/pages/size-guide">Size Guide</a> has detailed measurements for every style. We offer XS through XL in most pieces. If you're between sizes, the reviews often have helpful fit notes from real customers.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What if my size doesn't fit?</h3>
        <p>We offer complimentary exchanges within 15 days. Simply <a href="/pages/contact">reach out</a> and we'll arrange a size swap — no hassle.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Do you offer extended sizes?</h3>
        <p>Currently XS through XL. An expanded range is in development. <a href="/pages/contact">Let us know</a> if you'd like to be notified.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <h2>Fabrics & Care</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What fabrics do you use?</h3>
        <p>Our collection features premium modal blends, silk satin finishes, breathable cotton voile, and bamboo-cotton blends. Modal is naturally breathable, exceptionally soft, and gentle on sensitive skin.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How should I care for my Vivere?</h3>
        <p>Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle. Avoid bleach. Tumble dry low or lay flat to dry. Low heat iron if needed. With proper care, every piece is designed to endure beautifully.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Are your fabrics sustainable?</h3>
        <p>Modal is derived from natural wood pulp — more sustainable than polyester, less water-intensive than conventional cotton. We're committed to responsible sourcing across our supply chain.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <h2>Orders & Delivery</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How long does delivery take?</h3>
        <p>3-5 business days across India. Orders ship within 1-2 days of purchase. <a href="/pages/track-order">Track your order</a> anytime.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Do you offer complimentary shipping?</h3>
        <p>Yes — complimentary shipping on qualifying orders across India. Cash on delivery is available at every pin code.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Can I modify my order after placing it?</h3>
        <p>If your order hasn't shipped, we can often accommodate changes. <a href="/pages/contact">Contact us immediately</a> and we'll do our best.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <h2>Returns & Refunds</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What's your return policy?</h3>
        <p>15-day returns, no questions asked. Items must be unworn, unwashed, and in original condition. We arrange complimentary pickup. Full details on our <a href="/pages/returns">Returns page</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How long until I receive my refund?</h3>
        <p>5-7 business days after we receive and inspect the item. Refunds are processed to your original payment method.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <h2>Payment</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What payment methods do you accept?</h3>
        <p>Credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard), UPI, Razorpay, and Cash on Delivery. All transactions are encrypted and processed through Shopify's secure gateway.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Is my payment information secure?</h3>
        <p>Completely. We never store your card details. All payments are handled through Shopify's PCI-compliant secure infrastructure.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <div class="info-help">
        <h2>Still Have a Question?</h2>
        <p><a href="/pages/contact">Reach out to our team</a> — we typically respond within a few hours.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

